  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Annika Bergstrom, assistant Curator. Welcome to the Kulturgeschichtliches
    Wundermuseum\u2014the KWM, for obvious reasons.\n\nHere's the situation: This
    museum is failing. The board just fired their third curator in eighteen months.
    One organized our Dragon Claw collection by perceived sharpness. Another started
    a bidding war over a possibly-alive Mimic. The third... let's not discuss the
    Flamethrower incident.\n\nYou're here to save this place.\n\nThe good news? Our
    acquisition network is extraordinary. Tesla Coils. Bottled Supernovas. Phoenix
    Feathers. Mothman Wings. We even have something called a Witch's Cauldron I'm
    terrified to uncrate.\n\nYour job: Turn chaos into culture. Choose exhibits.
    Design galleries. Make seventeen visitors per week into something worth talking
    about.\n\nEvery choice matters. The Kraken Tentacle next to the Naval Battle
    Model tells a story. The Ice Crown with the Permafrost Orchid creates an experience.\n\nReady?
    Your first acquisition awaits"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc5db2ea4cf5218459e85e2080b6fd13, type: 2}
